{"id":"wb-8-506","name":"囊巴朗则石雕","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"囊巴朗则石雕","text":"囊巴朗则石雕位于中国西藏自治区昌都市芒康县帮达乡然堆村，是吐蕃时期的佛教石雕遗存，亦称朗巴朗增拉康造像。造像保存在佛殿内，由居中的大日如来与两侧的八大菩萨组成。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%8A%E5%B7%B4%E6%9C%97%E5%88%99%E7%9F%B3%E9%9B%95","revisionId":95039826,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95039826","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}